:Namespace MockHandlers
⍝ Handler functions used by unit tests.

    ∇ result←ListItems req
      result←(items: 'a' 'b' ⋄ total: 2)
    ∇

    ∇ result←GetItem req
      result←(id: req.PathParams.id)
    ∇

    ∇ result←CreateItem req
      req.SetStatus 201
      result←req.Payload
    ∇

    ∇ result←UpdateItem req
      result←(updated: 1)
    ∇

    ∇ result←DeleteItem req
      result←(deleted: 1)
    ∇

    ∇ result←SearchItems req;q
      q←req.QueryParams ⎕VGET ⊂(,'q') ''
      result←(query: q)
    ∇

    ∇ result←GetSpecialItem req
      result←(special: 1)
    ∇

    ∇ result←GetInvoice req
      result←(cust: req.PathParams.cust_id ⋄ inv: req.PathParams.inv_id)
    ∇

    ∇ result←BrokenHandler req
      ⎕SIGNAL ⊂('EN' 11)('Message' 'deliberate error for testing')
    ∇

    ∇ result←err HandleError req
      result←(EN: err.EN ⋄ message: err.Message)
    ∇

:EndNamespace
